{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 114,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "When Israel went out of Egypt, the house of Jacob from a people of foreign language,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "出了， 家离开说异言之民；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "出了， 家離開說異言之民；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "Judah became his sanctuary, Israel his dominion.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "那时，为主的圣所， 为他所治理的国度。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "那時，為主的聖所， 為他所治理的國度。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "The sea saw it, and fled. The Jordan was driven back.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "沧海看见就奔逃； 也倒流。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "滄海看見就奔逃； 也倒流。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "The mountains skipped like rams, the little hills like lambs.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "大山踊跃，如公羊；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "大山踴躍，如公羊；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "What was it, you sea, that you fled? You Jordan, that you turned back?",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "沧海啊，你为何奔逃？ 哪，你为何倒流？",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "滄海啊，你為何奔逃？ 哪，你為何倒流？",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "You mountains, that you skipped like rams? You little hills, like lambs?",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "大山哪，你为何踊跃，如公羊？",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "大山哪，你為何踴躍，如公羊？",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "Tremble, you earth, at the presence of the Lord, at the presence of the God of Jacob,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "大地啊，你因见主的面， 神的面，便要震动。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "大地啊，你因見主的面， 上帝的面，便要震動。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "who turned the rock into a pool of water, the flint into a spring of waters.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他叫磐石变为水池，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他叫磐石變為水池，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}